sequenceDiagram
    %% SD4 - Receive discounts and suggestions
    %% Stories: 10, 11, 12, 22, 46
    %% Description: An employee edits product discounts, and a customer is notified of a personal discount on frequently bought products. The customer turns on sale notifications and receives product suggestions.
    actor EM as Employee
    actor CP as Customer (person)
    participant PR as Product
    participant PD as PersonalDiscount
    participant CU as Customer
    participant OD as Order

    %% covers 46
    EM->>PR: edit product discount
    %% covers 11
    PR->>PD: discount on frequently bought products
    %% covers 12
    PD->>CU: notify of personal discount
    %% covers 22
    CP->>CU: turn on sale notifications
    %% covers 10
    CP->>CU: get product suggestions
    CU->>OD: previous orders
    OD->>PR: bought products
